  "masterScale": "MASTER_SCALE is required for every 3D manifest and is validated against deity \u2192 Character \u2192 Creature \u2192 Enemy \u2192 Gate \u2192 Structure \u2192 Prop \u2192 Terrain scale expectations.",
  "activeVisualArchitecture": "3D Characters + 3D Titans + 3D Creatures + 3D Battlefields + 3D Gates + 3D Props + Materials + Animations + VFX + Lighting. Old 2D battlefield sprites are deprecated.",
